Introducing the ultimate Boosty creative community for fans of all things creative! Boosty allows you to follow your favorite blogger, gamer, writer, artist, streamer and content creator from various fields all in one place. Boosty is a vibrant community of content creators and their followers. It is the perfect place to catch up on the latest broadcasts and blogs, exclusive content, and just for the fans community.


With Boosty creative platform, you can:
— Find new talented authors out of 650 thousand registered on the platform;
— Follow and support the creators you love;
— Easily discover blogs, videos, music and podcasts right in the app;
— Stay connected with the authors adding likes and comments on the posts;
— Receive notifications on new blog publications of content creators;
— Contact support for any questions and issues you might have.

Get access to exclusive, never-before-seen content available just for fans! Boosty exclusive fan house provides access to popular blog creators, whose creatively curated content is available just for fans. With our easy-to-use interface, exclusive content, and powerful tools for connecting with authors and fans, we're confident that you'll find everything you need to engage with the community you love.

With the Boosty app, you won't miss a single new post and comment. View broadcasts, photos and videos, read blogs, listen to the tracks of creators at any time! Discover new artists and influencers including gamers, musicians, artists, writers, bloggers, and other content creators and support them with your attention. Whether you're interested in art, music, blogs, gaming, or any other creative endeavor, Boosty has got you covered.

Download the application and immerse yourself in the fascinating world of creativity with your favorite authors!

The APP controls the flight of the quadcopter through wireless WIFI image transmission technology.
It has the following functions:
1. Connect WIFI to control the flight of the aircraft through the joystick;
2. Display the real-time streaming picture of the aircraft camera;
3, take photos, video, view photos and videos;
4. Control the flight of the aircraft through gravity induction;
5. Automatic trajectory flight;
6. Voice-controlled flight;
7. Gesture recognition, taking photos and video;
8. VR mode;
9. Music video mode;
10. Video special effects mode.
